    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n2 Beal Cuain is a charming 3-bedroom terraced property in the heart of Kinvara village. Beal Cuain literally means beside the harbour, and this house is just a minute's stroll from the quay. The property is in a lovely, small, peaceful development of 6 properties with private off-street parking. \n\nThe ground floor comprises of a hallway, spacious sitting room with solid fuel stove and kitchen/dining area with sliding door leading to the patio area rear. The first floor comprises of three bedrooms and a family bathroom. There is a patio area to the rear and a green area to the front. The property has just been repainted, and new carpeting has been installed throughout, as well as new electric heaters\n\nSituated on the Wild Atlantic Way, Kinvara is a warm and inviting seaside village with excellent services and facilities, primary and secondary schools and a community childcare facility and wonderful natural amenities. Kinvara is regarded as one of the most sought-after locations on the West Coast with an abundance of natural beauty and charm whilst easy commuting distance from major employment hubs such as Galway, Ennis, Shannon and Limerick. All accessible with the new M18 motorway which also connects Kinvara with the M6, Galway to Dublin motorway. \n\nSERVICES Mains\nHEATING SYSTEM Solid fuel stove/ Electric Heating\nPROPERTY AGE 2003\nPROPERTY SIZE 74m²\nBUILDING ENERGY RATING C1 119305241 160.98 (kWh/m2/yr) 22.88 (kgCO2/m2/yr) Exp: 07/04/2036"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.6m x 1.1m\n• Wooden flooring\n\nSitting Room - 4.5m x 4.2m\n• Wooden flooring • Solid fuel stove\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 5.2m x 2.6m\n• Wooden flooring • Fitted kitchen • Tiled splashback • Double doors to patio\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.6m x 3.3m\n• Carpeted flooring • Fitted wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.4m x 2.3m\n• Carpeted flooring • Fitted wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.3m x 2.8m\n• Carpeted flooring • Fitted wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 2.7m x 1.8m\n• Tiled floor and splashback • W.C. • W.H.B. • Bath • Shower\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 3 Bedroom property in the heart of the village</li><li> Just seconds from Kinvara Bay</li><li> Turn-key condition, ready to move into immediately</li><li> All amenities on your doorstep</ul>"
      },
